[34.764171, "i", "echo 'The SPARQL query uses the ex: namespace prefix to identify the library ontology. It selects books with the genre \"Fiction\", published after 2015, and authored by individuals with the nationality \"American\". The query returns the book title, author name, and publication year, sorted by publication year and then by book title alphabetically.' > /app/explanation.txt\n"]
